                                                "sense_id": "b911b4b1-aec9-3bde-9fef-d563ee51e749",
                                                "text": "I propose the term Chætotaxy for the arrangement of bristles on the different parts of the body of the Diptera, the composition of this term being analogous to phyllotaxy, the order or arrangement of leaves of plants."
                                            }
                                        ]
